<BaseLayout title="About PurpleTheta" description="Learn about PurpleTheta's approach to mathematics, learning and curiosity."><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A little about us</p><h1>Learning should make<br />you curious.</h1><p>PurpleTheta is a place for thoughtful learning—where mathematics is explained patiently, ideas are explored clearly and curiosity is encouraged.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap content-wrap prose"><h2>Our approach</h2><p>We believe understanding is more valuable than memorising a procedure without knowing why it works. PurpleTheta aims to make learning approachable through step-by-step explanations, examples, videos, reading and practice.</p><h2>What you'll find here</h2><ul><li>Class 8–10 mathematics learning material</li><li>Articles on mathematics, science and other interesting topics</li><li>Video lessons and explainers</li><li>Books and resources for curious readers</li></ul><p>We will keep adding content over time. The aim is simple: make useful ideas easier to understand and enjoyable to explore.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
